            "review_text": "Dydy\n3 contributions\n0\nBEST SUSHI IN TOWN\nJun 2023\nAbsolutely delicious sushi, sashimi and tempura! 😋 We ordered a good selection of these things and honestly couldn't fault anything! Even the sauces that came with it were so damn great. Everything was yummy and tasted extremely fresh, the prices are great for the venue, totally worth it and I will definitely be ordering from them again 😍 Sushi is literally one of my favourite dishes and this place really hit the spot!! Thank you!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 25, 2023\nSushi Masa\nThank you very much for your kind words about Sushi Masa! We are delighted to know that you had a pleasant dining experience at our establishment. Retaining the customers' satisfaction is Sushi Masa's biggest success.\nArigatou Gozaimasu!\nRead more\nWritten June 26, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
